# Bulk Actions

When managing large guest lists, you can save time by sending emails to multiple guests simultaneously. This guide covers the available bulk email actions.

## Selecting Guests

To select guests for bulk actions:

### Individual Selection

Click the checkbox on the left side of each guest row to select individual guests.

### Select All Visible

Click the checkbox in the table header to select all currently visible guests. If you have filters applied, only the filtered guests will be selected.

{% callout type="info" %}
The selection count appears in the toolbar showing how many guests are currently selected.
{% /callout %}

## Available Bulk Actions

When one or more guests are selected, a bulk action toolbar appears above the table with email options.

### Send Invitations

Send invitation emails to all selected guests using each category's default invitation template:

1. Select the guests you want to invite
2. Click **Send Invitations** in the bulk action toolbar
3. Review the confirmation dialog showing the number of guests
4. Click **Send** to dispatch the invitations

{% callout type="warning" %}
Each guest category must have an invitation template assigned before sending invitations. See Managing Categories for how to assign templates.
{% /callout %}

### Send Email Template

Send any email template to all selected guests:

1. Select the guests you want to email
2. Click **Send Email** in the bulk action toolbar
3. Choose the template you want to send from the dropdown
4. Review the confirmation dialog
5. Click **Send** to dispatch the emails

This is useful for sending reminders, updates, or any custom communication to a specific group of guests.

## Tips for Effective Bulk Emails

### Use Filters First

Before sending bulk emails, use the search and filter options to narrow down your selection:

- **Search** - Find guests by name, email, or organization
- **Status Filter** - Target guests with a specific RSVP status (e.g., only pending guests)
- **Category Filter** - Target guests in a specific category

This helps ensure you're only emailing the intended guests.

### Check the Count

Always verify the selection count in the toolbar matches your expectations before sending emails.

### Set Up Templates First

Make sure your email templates are created in the **Emails** tab before attempting bulk sends. For invitations, ensure each category has a default invitation template assigned.

### Clear Selection

Click the checkbox in the header again to deselect all guests, or click individual checkboxes to deselect specific guests.
